1 line: JSX text and attributes with `//` and `/*`, and comments in JSX expressions
3 trailing line: a generic arrow function, not an element
4 trailing line: a constrained generic arrow function
5 trailing line: a const type parameter
9 trailing block: a comment in a JSX expression
12 trailing line: a line comment in a JSX expression
14 trailing block: after a call
22 trailing line: after an element in parentheses
26 trailing line: after an element with a type argument
27 trailing line: division after a name
